---
import { INQUIRY_JUMP_HREF, INQUIRY_JUMP_LABEL } from '../../lib/inquiryForm';
---

<section class="border-y border-blue-100 bg-blue-50 py-6" aria-label="お問い合わせフォームへの移動">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-xl px-4 text-center sm:px-6">
    <a
      href={INQUIRY_JUMP_HREF}
      data-inquiry-jump="bottom"
      class="inline-flex min-h-14 w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-primary px-6 py-4 text-lg font-black text-white shadow-md hover:bg-primary-dark focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-900"
    >
      <span>{INQUIRY_JUMP_LABEL}</span>
      <svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 20 20" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0" fill="none">
        <path d="M10 4v10m0 0-4-4m4 4 4-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
      </svg>
    </a>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-bold leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
      ページ下部のフォームへ移動します。お名前、電話番号、メールアドレス、郵便番号、相談内容はすべて必須です。
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
